<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cowen cuts IBM 96 EPS.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cowen cuts IBM 96 EPS.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said it lowered its 1996 earnings estimate on International Business Machines Corp to $11.20 per share from $11.40.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were trading at 130-1/4, up 1-1/4 in latre afternoon exchange trading.</p>
</text>
